      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "We now have the necessary machinery in hand to perform power calculations for ANOVA designs. We consider fixed-effects designs first, using the simple one-way ANOVA to illustrate the basic approach. Letting $ y_{ij} $ denote the value of the",
      "source_page": 892,
      "printed_page": 872,
      "source_block_ids": [
