    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The distribution of $F$ depends on the distribution of the sums of squares. Since $\\overline{y}_{i} \\sim \\mathrm{N}(\\tau_{i}, \\sigma_{e}^{2}/n)$, Equation A5.15e gives",
