    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The noncentrality parameter $ \\lambda $ can also be expressed in terms of amount of the total variance attributable to model (treatment) effects, $ \\sigma_{\\tau}^{2} $. Since $ \\bar{\\tau} = 0 $ (by construction), it follows that",
