    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Finally, noting that $ y_{ij} - \\overline{y}_{i} = e_{ij} - \\overline{e}_{i} $. and that $ e_{ij} \\sim \\mathrm{N}(0, \\sigma_{e}^{2}) $, we have",
