    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "To find the sample size required to give this test power $ 1 - \\beta $, we equate Equation A5.23 to $ 1 - \\beta $ and solve for n given the fixed values of $ \\alpha $, $ \\beta $, N, and $ \\sum \\tau_i^2 / \\sigma_e^2 $ (or, equivalently, $ \\sigma_\\tau^2 / \\sigma_e^2 $).",
